!.agents/**
**/inventory/**
!**/inventory/**.example
**/inventory.y*ml
!**/inventory.y*ml.example
**/secrets.y*ml
**/controlplane.y*ml
**/worker.y*ml
**/talosconfig
**/kubeconfig
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
# Terraform / OpenTofu (provider binaries + module checkouts must never be committed)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl
.terraformrc
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# Ansible tooling artifact dirs (collections/modules/roles checkouts must never be committed)
**/.ansible/
# Go coverage profiles (go test -coverprofile)
coverage.out
cover.out
# Day-0/1 build secrets + chart pack artifacts (strays outside talos/ansible/build/;
# mirrors talos/.gitignore scoping — only *.template files are ever committed).
**/secrets.bundle.yml
**/proton-pass-pat
**/pat.yml
!**/pat.yml.template
*.tgz
# Staged upstreams fetched at publish time by projects/helm-*/ci/fetch.sh; never commit.
projects/helm-*/upstream/
projects/helm-*/.fetch-staging/
